category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libadios2-devel libviskores-devel rapidjson-devel
sdesc: "Library for reading ADIOS2 data into Viskores datasets (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Fides is a library that provides a schema for reading and writing
data stored in ADIOS2 using a JSON-based data model, and for turning it into
Viskores datasets for visualization."
skip:

homepage: https://gitlab.kitware.com/vtk/fides
license: BSD-3-Clause
